"⌘E 编辑文本或图片，⌘R 给条目起个名字，⌘N 新建一条文本。" = "⌘E edits text or an image, ⌘R gives an item a name, and ⌘N creates a new text item.";
"常用的内容可以固定到 Pinboard 里，不会随保留期限被清掉。" = "Keep things you use often on a Pinboard; pinned items aren’t removed when history expires.";
"把卡片拖到顶部的页签上就能固定；⇧⌘N 新建 Pinboard。" = "Drag a card onto a tab at the top to pin it. ⇧⌘N creates a Pinboard.";
"按 %@ / %@ 在页签之间切换。" = "Press %@ / %@ to switch between tabs.";
"按 %@ 打开 Paste Stack，之后复制的内容会依次排进队列；在面板里选中条目再按它，或右键选“创建 Stack”，就用选中的条目建一个。" = "Press %@ to open Paste Stack; everything you copy after that joins it in order. Select items in the panel and press it, or right-click and choose Create Stack, to start one from those items.";
"⌘V 每次粘出最上面一条。拖动行可以调整顺序，双击某一行先粘它，⌃⌥⌘V 一次粘出全部文本。" = "⌘V pastes the top row each time. Drag rows to change the order, double-click a row to paste it out of turn, and press ⌃⌥⌘V to paste all text at once.";
"点 × 移除一行；移除、提前粘出或拖到别的应用之后，可以点标题栏的撤销放回原处。" = "Click × to remove a row. After removing a row, pasting it early or dragging it into another app, Undo in the header puts it back.";
"删除、撤销与暂停" = "Deleting, Undoing and Pausing";
"按 Delete 删除选中的条目，⌘Z 可以撤销刚才的删除。" = "Press Delete to remove the selected items; ⌘Z brings back what you just deleted.";
"⌘T 暂停记录，再按一次恢复；也可以在菜单里选择暂停一段时间。" = "⌘T pauses recording and pressing it again resumes. The menu also lets you pause for a set time.";
"隐私与权限" = "Privacy and Permissions";
"密码管理器等标记为保密的内容不会被记录；在“设置 › 隐私”里还可以忽略指定的应用。" = "Content that password managers mark as confidential is never recorded. You can also ignore specific apps in Settings › Privacy.";
"要把内容直接粘贴到其他应用，需要在系统设置的“设备控制和数据访问”中允许 XPaste；不允许时内容会放进剪贴板，由你按 ⌘V 粘贴。" = "To paste straight into other apps, allow XPaste in Device Control and Data Access in System Settings. Otherwise the item goes to the clipboard and you press ⌘V to paste.";
"所有历史只保存在这台 Mac 上。" = "Your history is stored only on this Mac.";
"快捷键都可以在“设置 › 键盘快捷键”里修改。" = "You can change every shortcut in Settings › Keyboard Shortcuts.";

