"检查更新…" = "Check for Updates…";
"启动时检查更新" = "Check for updates at launch";
"只在启动时检查一次，有新版本才提示；关掉后只在点“检查更新…”时联网。" = "Checks once when XPaste starts and only speaks up if there is a new version. When off, XPaste goes online for updates only when you click “Check for Updates…”.";

"用鼠标滚轮滚动卡片" = "Scroll Cards with Mouse Wheel";
