"鼠标滚轮按住 ⇧ 左右滚动卡片；在“设置 › 通用”里打开“用鼠标滚轮滚动卡片”后不用按 ⇧。" = "Hold ⇧ while turning the mouse wheel to scroll the cards sideways, or turn on “Scroll Cards with Mouse Wheel” in Settings › General to scroll without ⇧.";
